id: pm-vcs-bcgs
title: Certify pm-vcs PM CLI SDK 2026.9.29 and committed self-host bundle
description: Pin repository-local PM CLI/SDK to published 2026.9.29 while retaining pm-ops 2026.9.28 and pm-changelog 2026.9.25. Regenerate the committed self-host bundle after source and PM evidence are committed. Verify full release gates and packed npm/Bun behavior. The separate all-source CDC benchmark coverage gap remains pm-vcs-tj07.
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-26T14:12:57.090Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-29T13:34:25.880Z"
assignee: claude-hub
claim_principal: claude-hub
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 120
acceptance_criteria: "Installed repository-local PM CLI/SDK equals published 2026.9.29; pm-changelog remains 2026.9.25 and pm-ops remains 2026.9.28; the committed selfhost.bundle tip tree matches the committed source and full release:check passes at the exact candidate head; packed npm/Bun functional VCS acceptance and strict tracker health pass; review, all-source coverage, and full forge/scale limits are stated independently."
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-28T06:20:17.332Z",claude-hub,"2026-09-28: pinned pm-ops 2026.9.28 and re-copied its templates/prepare-merge-driver.ts (pm-ops#124: the omit-dev skip now checks every Node resolution path for an incomplete hoisted pm-ops, so a broken ancestor install fails instead of silently skipping the merge drivers). release:check and changelog:check pass on this branch."
notes[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-26T14:24:18.713Z","harness:codex","author=codex,text=Installed @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.26, pm-changelog 2026.9.25, pm-ops 2026.9.26. Copied the exact pm-ops canonical prepare launcher; regenerated committed selfhost.bundle. Full release:check passed 789/789 tests, 0 skipped, c8 100/100/100/100, native TOON and strace acceptance, self-host source identity, zero production audit findings, npm pack dry run, changelog and attestation gates. Strict PM health passed with an existing advisory provenance warning."
  "2026-09-29T13:24:09.460Z",codex,"Fresh npm/npx and Bun/bunx projects installed packed pm-vcs 2026.7.30 with published CLI 2026.9.29. Both package installs reported copy.complete=true and activated the extension; each initialized native pm-vcs, staged and committed a real text file, then passed strict PM health with zero warnings. This was on the code-identical artifact before the local pin edit; exact new-head full gate and committed self-host bundle revalidation follow."
  "2026-09-29T13:34:25.880Z",codex,"Red-first full release:check on repository-local CLI 2026.9.29 failed the real native TOON and stat-cache installed-CLI tests: both still installed the whole checkout, which the CLI now refuses at its 10000-entry incomplete-source scan boundary. This is a package harness issue, not an upstream CLI defect. Replaced both with a shared npm-pack archive installer that fails closed on pack errors and invalid archive receipts; focused real process tests pass 14/14 with zero skips. CodeRabbit on prior head also identified an existing pm-ops directory without package.json not covered by tests; added that real fixture and verified fail-closed behavior. Full gate and committed self-host bundle revalidation follow."
files[5]{path,scope,note}:
  scripts/accept-native-toon.ts,project,Native TOON test consumes packed archive
  scripts/accept-stat-cache.ts,project,Stat-cache test consumes packed archive
  scripts/pm-environment.ts,project,Shared packed archive installation for installed CLI acceptance
  test/prepare-merge-driver.test.ts,project,CodeRabbit missing package metadata fixture
  test/quality-scripts.test.ts,project,Pack failure and acceptance behavior
tests[2]:
  - command: "npm run release:check"
    path: .
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 900
    provenance:
      author: "harness:codex"
      created_at: "2026-09-26T14:24:18.713Z"
      source_kind: local_mutation
      source_ref: chore/pm-vcs-cli-sdk-refresh-2026-9-26
  - command: node --test test/prepare-merge-driver.test.ts test/quality-scripts.test.ts
    path: test/quality-scripts.test.ts
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 120
    pm_context_mode: tracker
    workspace_context_mode: source
    provenance:
      author: codex
      created_at: "2026-09-29T13:34:25.307Z"
      source_kind: local_mutation
